{"3998990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep Sheol", "steam_appid": 3998990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dystopian future ruled by ruthless corporations, Special Agent Seth embarks on a mission to uncover why a secretive mining base for a new biological gas has gone silent. A nightmare awaits him: the gas has transformed the workers and nearby townsfolk into bloodthirsty zombies! <br>Fight through hordes of enemies, unravel the corporation’s dark conspiracy, and face Lovecraftian monsters in this fast-paced retro FPS with survival horror elements!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/extras/5bc0049f43461a728633b053dff2cba1.poster.avif?t=1787729434\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/extras/5bc0049f43461a728633b053dff2cba1.webm?t=1787729434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/extras/5bc0049f43461a728633b053dff2cba1.mp4?t=1787729434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, industrial retro vibe inspired by classic FPS games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management: ammo, meds, and food—every decision counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player vital stats system that impacts gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental analysis system highlighting key items and mission objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex logical and environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique blend of Lovecraftian mythology and dark sci-fi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack that heightens tensi