cision counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player vital stats system that impacts gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental analysis system highlighting key items and mission objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex logical and environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique blend of Lovecraftian mythology and dark sci-fi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack that heightens tension.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/extras/655ca726a1d7c8cb4a7c401a57a8bd23.poster.avif?t=1787729434\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/extras/655ca726a1d7c8cb4a7c401a57a8bd23.webm?t=1787729434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/extras/655ca726a1d7c8cb4a7c401a57a8bd23.mp4?t=1787729434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "In a dystopian future, Agent Seth investigates a corporate geological facility where a biological gas turned people into bloodthirsty monsters. Fight through enemy hordes, uncover a dark corporate conspiracy, and face Lovecraftian nightmares in this tense retro FPS with survival horror!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/2dc1f832d0f1972b90e7c39f804f6afa042309df/header.jpg?t=1787729434", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998990/555142ec23ceb6ecb2736f9557482892b453e577/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787729434", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/